      "category": "宗戚",
      "paragraph_from": 25,
      "paragraph_to": 25,
      "boundary_evidence": {
        "open_paragraph": 25,
        "open_phrase": "赵孝王良字次伯，光武之叔父也。平帝时举孝廉，为萧令。光武兄弟少孤，良抚循甚笃。及",
        "close_paragraph": 25,
